/-! # Reissner–Nordström (ingoing EF): parameter tangents and the nonzero test (ATLAS-IV-03)

Data `gRN M b`, `giRN M b`, `faradayRN Q`, `domRN = {r > 0, 0 < θ < π}` of IV-01, unchanged.

* **Parameter tangents** (`param_tangent`): for every real `M, Q` and every direction `(m, q)` (mass and
  charge, or any real combination; `M = 0`, `Q = 0`, `m = 0`, `q = 0` allowed, no division by `Q`), the
  actual family `ε ↦ (gRN (M+εm) ((Q+εq)²), giRN …, faradayRN (Q+εq))` is a `FamilyData` on
  `ℝ × domRN`, each member is certified (`EF.cert`), and its genuine tangent is the explicit
  `tanRN M Q m q` (only `h_vv = 2m/r - 2Qq/r²`) and `tanFRN q` (`f_rv = q/r² = -f_vr`). The bridge gives
  `LE = LJ = LH = 0` for this tangent on `domRN`.
* **Nonzero test** (`nonzero_theta`): the off-shell family `b = Q² + ε` (`M`, `Q`, `F` fixed) has the actual
  tangent `tanB` (`h_vv = -1/r²`, all other components `0`) and `f = 0`; the same `linEinstein` and the
  off-shell bridge give `LE_θθ(tanB, 0) = 1/r² ≠ 0` on `domRN`, from the IV-01 identity
  `E_θθ = (b - Q²)/r²`. `LJ` and `LH` vanish for this tangent (`J`, `H` vanish for every `b`). -/

open Real
open scoped ContDiff
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.RN

namespace ExactVacuumAtlas.Variation.RN

/-- Tangent of `gRN (M+εm) ((Q+εq)²)` at `ε = 0`: `h_vv = 2m/r - 2Qq/r²`, other components `0`. -/
noncomputable def tanRN (Q m q : ℝ) : Metric 4
  | 0, 0 => fun x => 2 * m / x 1 - 2 * Q * q / x 1 ^ 2
  | _, _ => fun _ => 0

/-- Tangent of `faradayRN (Q+εq)`: `f_vr = -q/r²`, `f_rv = q/r²`, other components `0`. -/
noncomputable def tanFRN (q : ℝ) : TwoForm 4
  | 0, 1 => fun x => -q / x 1 ^ 2
  | 1, 0 => fun x => q / x 1 ^ 2
  | _, _ => fun _ => 0

/-- Tangent of the off-shell family `gRN M (Q² + ε)`: `h_vv = -1/r²`, other components `0`. -/
noncomputable def tanB : Metric 4
  | 0, 0 => fun x => -1 / x 1 ^ 2
  | _, _ => fun _ => 0

/-- The product domain `ℝ × domRN`. -/
def domJ : Set (ℝ × Pt 4) := {p | p.2 ∈ domRN}

